Short:    FAME DoorHeader Creator V0.2
Uploader: siegel@deadline.snafu.de (Sascha Pfalz)
Author:   siegel@deadline.snafu.de (Sascha Pfalz)
Type:     util/cli

DoorHeader is a small CLI utility which allows FAME Door programmers to
create the Doordefinition datafiles automatically, i.e. out of an 
installerscript or similar. Fully argumentdriven and very small.
This tool is FreeWare.
